# Ignore dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/build
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Ignore Lockfiles (we copy them explicitly when needed, but ignore in context)
**/bun.lock
**/package-lock.json

# Ignore configs and env files
**/.env*
**/.agents
**/.system_generated
**/.prettier*

# Ignore docs and docker configs
**/README.md
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile*
